2026-08-09T13:45:00+08:00 sitemap and robots validation

Production endpoint checks
- GET https://grimmfirepump.cl/robots.txt => 200
- GET https://grimmfirepump.cl/sitemap.xml => 200

Source checks
- sitemap source emits only Spanish canonical public URLs.
- /en and /pt are excluded because they are noindex,follow preparation pages.
- legacy /es/products URLs are excluded because they permanently redirect to /es/productos.
- robots permits Googlebot, Bingbot, OAI-SearchBot and PerplexityBot for public pages.
- GPTBot is denied unless ALLOW_GPTBOT=true is set in the deployment environment.
- /admin and /api are disallowed from crawling.

Limitations
- Search Console and Bing Webmaster Tools submissions were not performed from this environment.
- A sitemap response does not prove crawler discovery or index inclusion.
